# Generative video

- Seedance 2.0 is the production platform. Native 4K, multi reference input.
- Veo and Omni Flash are for iteration only.
- Generate each shot in a separate session to prevent grade drift.
- UI elements and text overlays are composited in After Effects, never
  generated. Labels drift and text degrades.
- Grade drift correction is deferred to post.

# Image generation

- Positive prompt language overrides exclusion lists. Fix form drift by
  rewriting the positive clauses, not by extending negatives.
- Vocabulary carries unintended associations. Audit per noun.
- Keep all text and labeling out of generated images. Composite in post.

# ffmpeg

- concat demuxer with -c copy for lossless joining, only when codec,
  resolution, and frame rate match exactly.
- -sseof -0.1 for reliable final frame extraction.
- Alpha fade: fade=t=in:st=X:d=Y:alpha=1,fade=t=out:st=A:d=B:alpha=1 with
  enable='lt(t,T)' on the overlay filter.
- Set -framerate 24 on looped image input so fade timestamps resolve correctly.
